### `GET /api/v1/links/{code}/analytics/export.csv`

**Export daily click counts as CSV**

A CSV attachment with one row per UTC calendar day of the last N days (today included, zero-filled): `code`, `date`, `clicks` and the day's most frequent referrer. N is at most @@MAX_WINDOW_DAYS@@. Text cells that a spreadsheet could read as a formula are prefixed with a single quote. Clicks are recorded asynchronously, so very recent clicks may not be visible yet.

Authentication: `X-API-Key` header

| Parameter | In | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `code` | path | `string` | yes |  |
| `days` | query | `integer` | no | Window length in UTC calendar days, today included. Constraints: `minimum=1, maximum=@@MAX_WINDOW_DAYS@@`. |

| Status | Description | Body |
|---|---|---|
| 200 | The CSV attachment. | - |
| 401 | Missing or invalid API key. | `ErrorResponse` (application/json) |
| 404 | Not found (also returned for links owned by another key). | `ErrorResponse` (application/json) |
| 422 | Validation failed. | `ErrorResponse` (application/json) |
| 429 | Rate limit exceeded; see Retry-After and X-RateLimit-* headers. | `ErrorResponse` (application/json) |

